  "sticky_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_what_is_session",
      "text": "**Vivid Session** organizes your graph into Tracks and Clips.\n\n- A **Track** groups related nodes (e.g., all your drum synths)\n- A **Clip** is a named snapshot of those nodes' parameters\n- Launching a clip instantly restores the captured state\n\nPress **V** to open the Session strip.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": 20.0, "width": 340.0, "height": 130.0, "color": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "note_track_owns",
      "text": "The **Drums** track owns these four nodes.\n\nWhen you launch a clip, only the owned nodes are affected — other nodes stay unchanged.",
      "x": 430.0, "y": 20.0, "width": 300.0, "height": 80.0, "color": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "note_three_clips",
      "text": "**Three clips = three states:**\n\n**Sparse** — minimal intro beat (kick + hat)\n**Groove** — four-on-floor with snare ← active now\n**Dense** — full 8th-note kicks, 16th-note hats\n\nClick any clip cell to launch it.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": 520.0, "width": 360.0, "height": 120.0, "color": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note_try_it",
      "text": "**Try it!**\n1. Press **V** to open the Session strip\n2. Click **Sparse** — hear it go minimal\n3. Click **Dense** — maximum intensity\n4. Set quantize to **Bar** — clips snap to the next bar boundary",
      "x": 400.0, "y": 520.0, "width": 340.0, "height": 110.0, "color": 4
    }
  ],
